# Everything a verifier or a write-token job trusts. Under `pull_request` the
# workflow files, the scripts and the tool pins come from the PR head, so a PR
# can swap the verifier: required code-owner review on these paths is the
# mitigation (with "Require review from Code Owners" enabled in branch
# protection).
/.github/**   @michael-herwig
/scripts/**   @michael-herwig
/ocx.toml     @michael-herwig
/ocx.lock     @michael-herwig
# The pins are the review surface: the verifier proves the output renders the
# committed inputs, not where the pins came from.
/marketplace.lock  @michael-herwig
/marketplace.toml  @michael-herwig
